{"unit_id":"AtinyFurina__dsh-ctxedit#card-zh","repo":"AtinyFurina/dsh-ctxedit","commit":"ab59226d0c83f684f277b69cf9dad7ea57e0e7df","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ctxedit 是面向 DSH Web 对话界面的上下文编辑插件，会在助手消息动作栏加入编辑入口，并提供改写面板。用户可以改写回复正文与思考内容、把回复从模型下一轮可见历史中移除，或在有改写记录时恢复原始内容；也能从选定消息处回溯并隐藏后续对话。插件通过宿主路由追加替换事件处理操作，保留原始会话日志，不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。适合希望在继续对话前修正模型所见历史的 DSH 用户；需要手动注册插件并使用兼容的 DSH Web 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:242-265","lib/client.js:580-619","lib/client.js:734-754","lib/index.js:1017-1076"]}
{"unit_id":"AtinyFurina__dsh-ctxedit#card-en","repo":"AtinyFurina/dsh-ctxedit","commit":"ab59226d0c83f684f277b69cf9dad7ea57e0e7df","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ctxedit adds editing controls to DSH web conversations. Users can rewrite an assistant reply's text and reasoning, remove it from later model context, restore its original content, or rewind from a message. It preserves the original session log and needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:242-265","lib/client.js:580-619","lib/client.js:734-754","lib/index.js:1017-1076"]}
