{"unit_id":"AtinyFurina__dsh-ctxedit#feature-1","repo":"AtinyFurina/dsh-ctxedit","commit":"ab59226d0c83f684f277b69cf9dad7ea57e0e7df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ctxedit 的功能「改写助手回复」：在消息动作栏打开编辑面板，修改正文和思考内容并保存；模型下一轮读取新内容，原始日志保持不变。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:242-265","lib/index.js:1017-1037"]}
{"unit_id":"AtinyFurina__dsh-ctxedit#feature-2","repo":"AtinyFurina/dsh-ctxedit","commit":"ab59226d0c83f684f277b69cf9dad7ea57e0e7df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ctxedit 的功能「删除模型可见回复」：从消息操作中选择抹掉后，宿主追加遮蔽事件，使模型下一轮不再看到该助手回复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:595-608","lib/index.js:1060-1064"]}
{"unit_id":"AtinyFurina__dsh-ctxedit#feature-3","repo":"AtinyFurina/dsh-ctxedit","commit":"ab59226d0c83f684f277b69cf9dad7ea57e0e7df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ctxedit 的功能「恢复原始回复」：对存在改写血统的消息选择还原，插件重新写入原始正文和思考内容，并让模型后续重新看到原话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:580-593","lib/index.js:1038-1059"]}
{"unit_id":"AtinyFurina__dsh-ctxedit#feature-4","repo":"AtinyFurina/dsh-ctxedit","commit":"ab59226d0c83f684f277b69cf9dad7ea57e0e7df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ctxedit 的功能「就地回溯」：点击用户消息旁的回退图标，将该消息及后续内容从模型视野移除并在界面隐藏，同时尝试把锚点原文复制到剪贴板。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:734-754","lib/index.js:733-827"]}
{"unit_id":"AtinyFurina__dsh-ctxedit#caveat-1","repo":"AtinyFurina/dsh-ctxedit","commit":"ab59226d0c83f684f277b69cf9dad7ea57e0e7df","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ctxedit 的使用须知：改写和删除操作通过追加事件调整模型可见历史，不改写原始会话日志；卸载插件后原始内容会重新显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:506-557","lib/client.js:595-608"]}
